    "name": "Tailor Simulator",
    "steam_appid": 3484750,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/dac592180c1f7a26ff23be1cb305357a.avif?t=1755338213\" width=800 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/da30817c5fdad95075084a33b22fd94a.poster.avif?t=1755338213\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/da30817c5fdad95075084a33b22fd94a.webm?t=1755338213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/da30817c5fdad95075084a33b22fd94a.mp4?t=1755338213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i><strong>From Workshop to Empire! Manage your workshop as a master craftsperson, design unique clothes, and fascinate your customers. Show your art by working with various materials from cotton to linen, nylon to polyester. Stay organized, meet your deadlines, and watch your small workshop grow into a tailoring\u00a0business. From the smallest scissor to the largest shelf, transform every corner of your workshop into a reflection of your\u00a0art. Prove yourself on this journey to become both a talented craftsperson and a successful entrepreneur!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/efcb1d462d795fd8ea73d7cb9169bebc.avif?t=1755338213\" width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/17320cd17665b3f5a20030f518c017f8.poster.avif?t=1755338213\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/17320cd17665b3f5a20030f518c017f8.webm?t=1755338213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/17320cd17665b3f5a20030f518c017f8.mp4?t=1755338213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Shape your business as you want it! Place furniture, tear down walls, and create a unique environment that attracts customers while enhancing\u00a0your production power. Every decoration choice directly affects both visual appeal and production capacity. Start with a small workshop and transform it into a massive factory empire in later updates. The  success lies in your creativity!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/a821ff2b5920bbb612d9fe9eea478f51.avif?t=1755338213\" width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/4dd41ed7167d8907315b1126659b9036.poster.avif?t=1755338213\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/4dd41ed7167d8907315b1126659b9036.webm?t=1755338213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/4dd41ed7167d8907315b1126659b9036.mp4?t=1755338213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Create Style with Unlimited Combination Options! Equip your workshop with 250,000+ unique clothing combinations and take customer satisfaction to the peak! Create collections that appeal to every taste and style with fabric varieties in different textures and patterns. Turn your hesitant customers into loyal ones by offering unlimited choices!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/789baac42d45e192413f6ba3364a6405.avif?t=1755338213\" width=800 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/ecdf7619be47156bf4c64bd7e8dd8fd8.poster.avif?t=1755338213\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/ecdf7619be47156bf4c64bd7e8dd8fd8.webm?t=1755338213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/ecdf7619be47156bf4c64bd7e8dd8fd8.mp4?t=1755338213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 <i><strong>Step into Emporium District, the most profitable and vibrant business area of the city! Run your Tailor Shop exploring and interacting with Jazz Bar, Restaurant, Casino, Night Club, Technocomp, OE Broker, Wholesale and Coffee Shop. Enjoy Emporium District and grow your textile empire!</strong></i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/dac592180c1f7a26ff23be1cb305357a.avif?t=1755338213\" width=800 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/da30817c5fdad95075084a33b22fd94a.poster.avif?t=1755338213\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/da30817c5fdad95075084a33b22fd94a.webm?t=1755338213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/da30817c5fdad95075084a33b22fd94a.mp4?t=1755338213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i><strong>From Workshop to Empire! Manage your workshop as a master craftsperson, design unique clothes, and fascinate your customers. Show your art by working with various materials from cotton to linen, nylon to polyester. Stay organized, meet your deadlines, and watch your small workshop grow into a tailoring\u00a0business. From the smallest scissor to the largest shelf, transform every corner of your workshop into a reflection of your\u00a0art. Prove yourself on this journey to become both a talented craftsperson and a successful entrepreneur!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/efcb1d462d795fd8ea73d7cb9169bebc.avif?t=1755338213\" width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/17320cd17665b3f5a20030f518c017f8.poster.avif?t=1755338213\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/17320cd17665b3f5a20030f518c017f8.webm?t=1755338213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/17320cd17665b3f5a20030f518c017f8.mp4?t=1755338213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Shape your business as you want it! Place furniture, tear down walls, and create a unique environment that attracts customers while enhancing\u00a0your production power. Every decoration choice directly affects both visual appeal and production capacity. Start with a small workshop and transform it into a massive factory empire in later updates. The  success lies in your creativity!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/a821ff2b5920bbb612d9fe9eea478f51.avif?t=1755338213\" width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/4dd41ed7167d8907315b1126659b9036.poster.avif?t=1755338213\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/4dd41ed7167d8907315b1126659b9036.webm?t=1755338213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/4dd41ed7167d8907315b1126659b9036.mp4?t=1755338213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Create Style with Unlimited Combination Options! Equip your workshop with 250,000+ unique clothing combinations and take customer satisfaction to the peak! Create collections that appeal to every taste and style with fabric varieties in different textures and patterns. Turn your hesitant customers into loyal ones by offering unlimited choices!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/789baac42d45e192413f6ba3364a6405.avif?t=1755338213\" width=800 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/ecdf7619be47156bf4c64bd7e8dd8fd8.poster.avif?t=1755338213\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/ecdf7619be47156bf4c64bd7e8dd8fd8.webm?t=1755338213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484750/extras/ecdf7619be47156bf4c64bd7e8dd8fd8.mp4?t=1755338213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 <i><strong>Step into Emporium District, the most profitable and vibrant business area of the city! Run your Tailor Shop exploring and interacting with Jazz Bar, Restaurant, Casino, Night Club, Technocomp, OE Broker, Wholesale and Coffee Shop. Enjoy Emporium District and grow your textile empire!</strong></i></p>",
    "short_description": "Build and rule your own tailoring and textile empire. Draw out your art! Open your workshop, deliver your customers\u2019 demands and design different clothes to sell in your store. Upgrade your workshop and rule the textile industry. Begin as a rookie tailor and become a businessperson.",
